  "description": "IGODUE crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 4/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C80 H121 O42 Tb9,H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2C (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2A (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2B (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb3C (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb3A (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb3B (Tb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 20 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.615-5.157 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.32-168.36°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C80H123Tb9O43. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 μ4-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
